        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:003",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "我还说你们科学课又……",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-11-04-where-does-rain-come-from_dialogue_003_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "003",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:004",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "科学课确实教了。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-11-04-where-does-rain-come-from_dialogue_004_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "004",
          "speaker": "孩子"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:005",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "水蒸气遇到冷空气形成水滴，太重了掉下来就是雨。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-11-04-where-does-rain-come-from_dialogue_005_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "005",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:006",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "雨又变成水蒸气，又再上去。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-11-04-where-does-rain-come-from_dialogue_006_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "006",
          "speaker": "孩子"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:007",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "是啊，所以说是有些循环吗？",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-11-04-where-does-rain-come-from_dialogue_007_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "007",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:008",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "你看，大海占地球70%吧，大海的水太阳一照就挥发到天空。所以靠近沿海就经常下雨。",
